    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Agent Panda. Your have been sent, by Sargent Hippo, to Puzzle Islands. Someone has been scattering puzzles about the islands and it is your job to find out who it is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You travel from island to island interviewing witnesses along the way to get clues.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way you must solve many panel puzzles, which will activate different areas of the island. There are over 200 puzzles to solve!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to piece together the clues to solve the mystery of Puzzle Islands? Only by interviewing all the characters will you be able to solve the final puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will meet many quirky characters along the way, including Henrietta Hippo and Ginger the Giraffe. There are over 13 characters to interview, each with unique personalities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must enter many establishments including Linda's Coffee Shop, Edwardo's Comedy Club and the Hipster Aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Agent Panda. Your have been sent, by Sargent Hippo, to Puzzle Islands. Someone has been scattering puzzles about the islands and it is your job to find out who it is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You travel from island to island interviewing witnesses along the way to get clues.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way you must solve many panel puzzles, which will activate different areas of the island. There are over 200 puzzles to solve!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to piece together the clues to solve the mystery of Puzzle Islands? Only by interviewing all the characters will you be able to solve the final puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will meet many quirky characters along the way, including Henrietta Hippo and Ginger the Giraffe. There are over 13 characters to interview, each with unique personalities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must enter many establishments including Linda's Coffee Shop, Edwardo's Comedy Club and the Hipster Aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "You are Agent Panda - a fearless detective trying to solve the mystery of Puzzle Islands. You must solve many puzzles and interview many quirky witnesses in order to find the mastermind! Who has been setting up all the puzzles? A light-hearted detective puzzle game with character.",
